docs/travelog.md:72:> F1 — Composition is where this project's real failure modes have actually lived. The bridge finding was an interaction fault between two models' clock abstractions. The checkmark relay is a composition failure between verification and rendering. The two-worlds attack composes channels. Per-property models each hold their own invariant while the adversary walks a seam between them; the capstone ledger records assumptions at joins but cannot exhibit an attack trace that threads several stages. §8's own words are "proving our own composition" — an integrated adversarial model is the most literal reading of the registered gate, not an addition to it.
