docs/V1-RELEASE-KEY-CUSTODY-DRAFT.md:42:| owner instance | The AI collaborator on the operational computer. It never holds the release key or its passphrase. |
docs/V1-RELEASE-KEY-CUSTODY-DRAFT.md:45:| release archive | The exact file that the release key signs. It contains the verifier and its trust file. |
docs/V1-RELEASE-KEY-CUSTODY-DRAFT.md:51:| signing session | A fresh live-boot session that holds the release key for one operation. |
docs/V1-RELEASE-KEY-CUSTODY-DRAFT.md:53:| custody | The storage of the release key and the control of its use. |
