docs/reviews/spec-sufficiency/GAPS.md:129:| **Root KSKs and lifetimes** | KSK-2017/2024, separate signing/reliance/publication/revocation periods; interval [signing-start, signing-end+L], L sourced/observed; some dates and L=21d in P (`docs/phase-0-prereg-amendment-9.md:307-323`; `docs/V1-PROFILE.md:221-251`). | Actual DNSKEY/public-key bytes, encoding and authentic source archive; complete period starts/end representations and cited validity evidence in the allowed set. Names/key tags alone are not trust anchors. Historical RRSIG evaluation needs the relevant DNSSEC time/serial rules. Retain old KSKs; do not replace them with whatever key is current in 2106. |
