docs/reviews/amendment-10-r4/DISPOSITION.md:11:- **R4-04 (MEDIUM), ACCEPTED.** A10.4.1 gains Codex's reporting insertion between profile rows 15.2 and 16.1, with the listing-subcheck table and the new code `LISTING_STAMP_MISMATCH` (four new A10.4.1 codes in all). Header rows 10.1–10.3 are extended, the classifier is placed in the order, and the agreement cases are listed. Verdict stability is limited to the tuple classifier. Row 37 and the mechanism accounting are updated, and the profile changes are deferred to after the signing commit.
