   371	Issuer duties that are not verifier rules: an attempt whose T would exceed not-after is not shipped [A9:422-423]; the
   372	`gpg` signer refuses a frame whose `declared_issue_time` is more than ε from its clock [A9:401-405]; the issuer never
   373	re-authorizes a key [A9:266]; public publication of the commit stays an issuer duty [A9:495-500]; the issuer
   374	re-captures the DNSSEC snapshot before shipping if it fails the snapshot rule [DD:94].
