    14	  --project tessera-slot2 --region us-east1 --async` once per request batch (logged, recorded in
    15	  `<run>/sigs/requests.json`); `run.json` `signers.trigger_slot2` (default true in real mode) turns it off. The
    16	  scheduler stays paused. Tests: `tests/test_signers_fixes.py` (`test_trigger_*`, `test_make_default_on...`,
    17	  `test_init_real_writes_trigger_option`), subprocess mocked, never executed.
