   688	These stages explain qualification and selection within the existing verifier. They do not replace other
   689	registered checks, their dependencies, or dispatch and reason-code precedence. A failure of an independently
   690	performable required check takes precedence over an unperformable check under A4.2. The header-pool link checks,
   691	OTS grammar and stamp checks, and selected-height transaction/path checks remain unchanged. A stage's UNVERIFIABLE
